d within the extended warehouse as within the concept of additional business.
For the purposes of the instant[ appeal], it was[ sufficient] to consider the third new agreement, the essential structure of which was the same as that of the revised agreement and, as was common ground, it was permissible to[ construe] the new agreement and the side-letter against the background of that revised agreement, HIH Casualty &[ General] Insurance Ltd v New Hampshire Insurance

