SOAP::Lite does[ allow] you to make[ an] RPC call through a WSDL document like a local method call: GetEx[change]Rate('[USD]', 'JPY', '2007-07-07').
SOAP::Lite is[ smart] to convert the RPC call into a SOAP request message.
